---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AppSettings from '../components/AppSettings.astro';
import InitReadiness from '../components/InitReadiness.astro';
---
<Base title="Init: make it yours" description="Configure independent mini-apps and export one portable specification with a complete copy-to-Codex handoff."><div class="init-heading"><h1>Give your app some shape.</h1><p class="lede">Your agent prepares the environment in <a href="/ready">Get Ready</a>, then uses this specification to build and deploy. Edit the fields, preview the result and take the portable specification to your agent. Your draft stays on this device.</p></div><InitReadiness/><p class="content-model-entry">Need your own content types and fields? <a href="/init/content">Design an EmDash content model and try its form.</a></p><div class="workbench init-workspace"><form id="init-form"><fieldset><legend>Your starting point</legend><label>Apps<select name="preset"><option value="composition">Guestbook + Showcase</option><option value="guestbook">Photo Guestbook</option><option value="showcase">Curated Showcase</option><option value="hello">Hello World reference</option></select></label><label>Title<input name="title" required maxlength="80" value="Our corner"/></label><label>Introduction<textarea name="intro" maxlength="240">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Appearance</legend><label>Theme<select name="theme"><option value="daylight">Daylight</option><option value="midnight">Midnight</option></select></label><label id="layout-label">Layout<select name="layout"><option value="grid">Gallery grid</option><option value="editorial">Larger editorial images</option></select></label></fieldset><AppSettings/><fieldset id="privacy"><legend>Publication</legend><p>Submitted photos stay private until the owner approves them. Hiding a contribution removes its controlled media and featured cards.</p><span class="badge">Review first · supported safe default</span></fieldset><fieldset id="cards-field"><legend>Your curated links</legend><p class="small">Give each card a title and an HTTPS link. Remove an unfinished card to leave it out. Connected galleries supply featured photos.</p><div id="card-rows"></div><button type="button" class="secondary" id="add-card">Add a card</button></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Deployment intent</legend><label>Destination<select name="target"><option value="preview">A temporary Cloudflare address</option><option value="existing-domain">An existing domain</option><option value="new-domain">Explore a new domain</option></select></label><label id="hostname-label" hidden>Hostname<input name="hostname" placeholder="app.example.com" maxlength="253"/></label><p id="target-help" class="small">The agent verifies the actual account and toolchain before deployment.</p></fieldset><div class="actions"><button>Save and preview</button><button type="button" id="reset" class="secondary">Start a fresh draft</button></div><label>Import a saved spec<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json"/></label><p role="status" aria-live="polite" id="message" class="message"></p></form><aside class="sticky"><div class="actions"><button id="download" class="secondary">Download spec</button><button id="copy">Copy to Codex</button></div><div class="app-layout-preview" data-layout-preview><div class="preview-caption">Layout preview · sample content</div><div data-app-layout></div></div><div class="ink preview-detail"><h2 id="preview-title">Our corner</h2><p id="preview-intro" class="lede">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</p><p id="preview-apps">Guestbook + Showcase</p><div id="preview-settings"></div><p class="small" id="preset-story">Here / there collects and reviews the photos. Top shelf gives approved moments and curated links a place together.</p></div><details><summary>Portable specification</summary><pre id="spec"></pre></details><details><summary>Read the agent handoff</summary><pre id="prompt"></pre></details><p class="small">No credentials go into this spec. A copied prompt is a handoff, not proof that an agent executed it.</p></aside></div><script src="../lib/init-client.ts"></script></Base>

<style>
 .init-heading h1{font-size:3rem;max-width:26ch;margin-top:0}.init-heading .lede{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:76ch}.init-workspace{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px}.app-layout-preview{background:var(--color-surface);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-top:24px}.preview-caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-muted);margin-bottom:14px}.preview-detail{margin-top:20px;padding:22px}.preview-detail h2{font-size:1.7rem}.preview-detail :global(h3){font-size:1.1rem;margin:18px 0 8px}.preview-detail :global(p){font-size:14px}.init-workspace :global(fieldset){padding:20px}.init-workspace :global(legend){font-size:15px}
 @media(max-width:900px){.init-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.init-workspace>aside{position:static}.init-heading h1{font-size:2.3rem}.app-layout-preview{margin-top:0}}
</style>
<style is:global>
 .sample-app{background:#f7f5ef;color:#263d32;padding:22px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:16px;overflow:hidden}.sample-app:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.sample-app[data-theme=midnight]{background:#182f26;color:#f4f0e8}.sample-app .sample-brand{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:16px;opacity:.8}.sample-app h3{font-size:1.6rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-app>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 20px;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.sample-photos.editorial{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sample-photos figure{min-width:0}.sample-photos img{display:block;width:100%;height:160px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px}.sample-photos figcaption{font-size:11px;padding-top:8px}.sample-link{display:block;border-top:1px solid currentColor;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-app .sample-kind{font-size:11px;margin-top:12px;opacity:.8}.sample-hello{min-height:170px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
</style>
